@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create enquiry (pricing → expect SOP match)
# @name createPricing
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Priya Sharma",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "subject": "Need pricing for 3 seats",
  "message": "Hi, can you share pricing for three seats on the Growth plan?"
}

### History (poll until status is matched or escalated)
@enquiryId = {{createPricing.response.body.enquiry.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/enquiry/{{enquiryId}}/history

### Create enquiry (no keywords → auto escalate)
# @name createEscalate
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Alex Kim",
  "channel": "email",
  "subject": "Hello",
  "message": "Just checking in — no specific topic."
}

### Follow-up
@escalateId = {{createEscalate.response.body.enquiry.id}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiry/{{escalateId}}/follow-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Actually we also need help with a refund on invoice 9921."
}

### Manual escalate
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiry/{{enquiryId}}/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer requests legal review before contract"
}

### Not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/enquiry/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/history
